u need.</string><string name="wizard_step_9_desc">All your conversations are saved automatically. Browse your history, pick up chats where you left off, and organize your conversations by model or provider.</string><string name="wizard_step_1_cta">Get Started</string><string name="wizard_step_2_cta">View Models</string><string name="wizard_step_4_cta">Import Model</string><string name="wizard_step_5_cta">Go to Chat</string><string name="wizard_step_6_cta">Set Up Endpoints</string><string name="wizard_step_7_cta">Try Remote Chat</string><string name="wizard_step_8_cta">Create Preset</string><string name="wizard_step_9_cta">View History</string><string name="wizard_step_4_desc_has">You already have %1$d LiteRT-LM %2$s imported. You can import more from your device storage.</string><string name="wizard_step_4_desc_no">Import your first .litertlm model from your device storage. LiteRT-LM is optimized for Android with GPU acceleration.</string><string name="wizard_step_6_desc_has">You already have %1$d %2$s configured. Connect more providers or manage existing ones!</string><string name="wizard_step_6_desc_no">Set up your first endpoint to connect to OpenAI, Anthropic, Ollama, or LM Studio. Your API keys are stored securely on your device.</string><string name="wizard_step_8_desc_has">You already have %1$d %2$s saved. Create new presets for different conversation styles.</string><string name="wizard_step_8_desc_no">Create your first generation preset. Define temperature, max tokens, seed, and more to reuse your favorite settings.</string><string name="wizard_step_9_desc_has">You already have %1$d %2$s in your history. Pick up any of them from the conversation panel.</string><string name="wizard_step_9_desc_no">Your conversation history will appear here. Each chat is automatically saved so you can return to it anytime.</string><string name="wizard_badge_has_litertlm">You have %1$d LiteRT-LM %2$s imported</string><string name="wizard_badge_no_litertlm">No LiteRT-LM models 